{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53925","headline":"题东林寺 二 · 周碏","name":"题东林寺 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"再崇玄法象西天，宏閈新高碧嶂前。\n风送片云招白马，鹤迎贫女诱金钱。\n沙门觅佛曾谙路，苦海悲人易得船。\n三教共兴谈帝道，大中年是太平年。\n（见《吉石盦丛书》影宋本陈舜俞《庐山记》卷四，原署：「布衣周碏」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周碏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53925.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53925","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}